{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Trick or Treat Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 3867270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Little Johnny, a kid in dire need of a Halloween costume who has to make do with whatever he can throw together using household supplies. Once you have your costume, out into the real world you go for some trick-or-treating! But this isn't your average night in suburbia... many strange things are afoot, and it's up to you to solve the puzzles if you want to enjoy all the delicious Halloween candies!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-or-Treat Adventure features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory items to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to interact with around an insane neighborhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror movie and pop-culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of evil to battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan (yeah, we were just as surprised as you are that he agreed to do a cameo!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more can be found in this big Halloweeny tale inspired by the classic point-&amp;-click adventure games of yesteryear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Halloween!\u00a0\ud83c\udf83</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Little Johnny, a kid in dire need of a Halloween costume who has to make do with whatever he can throw together using household supplies. Once you have your costume, out into the real world you go for some trick-or-treating! But this isn't your average night in suburbia... many strange things are afoot, and it's up to you to solve the puzzles if you want to enjoy all the delicious Halloween candies!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-or-Treat Adventure features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory items to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to interact with around an insane neighborhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror movie and pop-culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of evil to battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan (yeah, we were just as surprised as you are that he agreed to do a cameo!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more can be found in this big Halloweeny tale inspired by the classic point-&amp;-click adventure games of yesteryear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Halloween!\u00a0\ud83c\udf83</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A nostalgic Halloween retro point-&amp;-click adventure game. You must help Little Johnny put a Halloween costume together, go trick-or-treating for all the candies, and defeat the forces of evil!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI did not expect SOOOOOOOOOOO MUCHHHHH this is amazing humor and darkness in one pixelated point-n-click!\u201d<br />\r\n5/5 \u2013 VolknerBat<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cAWSOME, GREAT! I've always liked point 'n click adventures. So many jokes I needed an extra hour 'cause I laughed so much\u201d<br />\r\n5/5 \u2013 ThunderEagle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cOne of the most... professional and polished games I ever played. The humor in the script is absolutely hilarious. Reminds me a little of Maniac Mansion (Geeze I'm old). Fantastic in every way... and it takes all the other 'retro games' and flushes them down the toilet.\u201d<br />\r\n5/5 \u2013 RedEye<br />\r\n",
